    "payload": "Verified research, Grok entry, hook_payload_example (~/.grok/docs/user-guide/10-hooks.md lines 388-398 and 678): camelCase hookEventName/sessionId/toolName/toolInput plus the Claude snake_case aliases session_id, transcript_path, permission_mode, tool_name, tool_input, tool_response, tool_use_id. Skeptic verdict hook_payload_example: confirmed; hookEventName carries pre_tool_use while hook_event_name carries PreToolUse.",
