    "matcher": "Grok matchers alias Claude names (Bash to run_terminal_command, Edit/Write/MultiEdit to search_replace, Read to read_file), so the Claude matcher selects Grok's shell and edit tools and the hooks fire. Skill has no Grok alias, so companion-preference never fires."
